WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Here is how to enjoy your Caffiend soufflé.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.000
Start by tasting just the soufflé and cream together.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Next, add ice cream and fruit to the soufflé and cream.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Soufflé, cream, ice cream, and fruit.
Enjoy all four together in one bite.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.791
Enjoy every bite at Caffiend.
